# 0 PC-indexed JMP dispatch sites with no static table coverage.
# Format: <jmp_pc> <table_base> <ext_word> <reason>
# Reason: 0=no manual jump_table directive, 1=auto-walk yielded too few entries, 2=non-PC-indexed JMP variant
# Each line is one runtime dynamic dispatch — add a
# matching game.toml [[jump_table]] entry (or update the
# disasm_jumptables discovery file) after validation
# to convert it to static enumeration.
